---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<section class="product-proof" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="proof-head">
      <h2 id="proof-title">Real tools, not toy demos.</h2>
      <p>
        The examples exercise workspaces, editors, charts, input, images, and
        host integration against the same public framework.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="proof-gallery">
      <figure class="proof-item proof-item--wide">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/SwiftTUI/swift-tui-examples/tree/main/terminal-workspace"
          rel="noreferrer noopener"
        >
          <img
            src={`${base}/showcase/terminal-workspace.png`}
            width="1600"
            height="1000"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            alt="SwiftTUI Terminal Workspace with tabs, split panes, and a command palette"
          />
        </a>
        <figcaption>
          <strong>Terminal Workspace</strong>
          <span>Tabs, splits, a command palette, persisted layout, and embedded PTYs.</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="proof-item">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/SwiftTUI/swift-tui-examples/tree/main/gifeditor"
          rel="noreferrer noopener"
        >
          <img
            src={`${base}/showcase/gifeditor.png`}
            width="1600"
            height="1000"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            alt="SwiftTUI GIF Editor with canvas, layers, tools, and a timeline"
          />
        </a>
        <figcaption>
          <strong>GIF Editor</strong>
          <span>Layers, timeline, pointer tools, undo, and export.</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="proof-item">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/SwiftTUI/swift-tui-examples/tree/main/gitviz"
          rel="noreferrer noopener"
        >
          <img
            src={`${base}/showcase/gitviz.png`}
            width="1600"
            height="1000"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            alt="SwiftTUI GitViz dashboard showing charts built from repository history"
          />
        </a>
        <figcaption>
          <strong>GitViz</strong>
          <span>SwiftTUICharts primitives over actual repository history.</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <a class="proof-link" href={`${base}/showcase/`}>See every example and host</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="why" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="why-thesis">
      <p>Swift is a language, not a platform.</p>
      <h2 id="why-title">SwiftUI-shaped authoring. Terminal-native output.</h2>
    </div>

    <dl class="reason-list" id="surface">
      <div>
        <dt>Use the model you know.</dt>
        <dd>
          Compose <code>View</code>, <code>App</code>, and <code>Scene</code>{" "}
          values with state, focus, layout, controls, and modifiers.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Inspect the committed frame.</dt>
        <dd>
          Geometry, semantics, styled cells, and raster output move through a
          strict pipeline that can be tested before presentation.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Keep terminal behavior native.</dt>
        <dd>
          Capability-aware color, links, images, mouse input, alternate screens,
          signals, and PTY-backed surfaces stay part of the system.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hosts" id="hosts" aria-labelledby="hosts-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="hosts-head">
      <h2 id="hosts-title">One authored tree. Thin host-specific bootstrap.</h2>
      <p>
        SwiftTUI keeps the view model and committed frame stable while each
        platform owns the integration work that belongs to it.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="host-map">
      <div class="engine">
        <span>SwiftTUI</span>
        <strong>View tree to committed cells and semantics</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="host-list">
        <span>Terminal executable</span>
        <span>Static WASI browser app</span>
        <span>Localhost WebHost</span>
        <span>Native SwiftUI surface</span>
        <span>Android Compose surface</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="host-caveat">
      The authored view tree is shared. Launch, lifecycle, input bridges,
      accessibility presentation, and platform packaging remain host-specific.
    </p>

    <nav class="audience-paths" aria-label="Choose a SwiftTUI guide">
      <a href={`${base}/docs/documentation/`}>
        <span>I author Swift</span>
        <strong>Views, state, focus, layout, and controls</strong>
        <i>Open DocC</i>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/SwiftTUI/swift-tui/blob/main/docs/HOSTS-AND-PLATFORMS.md"
        rel="noreferrer noopener"
      >
        <span>I build terminal tools</span>
        <strong>Cells, input, PTYs, images, and capabilities</strong>
        <i>Open the host guide</i>
      </a>
      <a href={`${base}/showcase/`}>
        <span>I need proof</span>
        <strong>Maintained applications across the host family</strong>
        <i>Browse examples</i>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="confidence" aria-labelledby="confidence-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="confidence-copy">
      <p class="home-kicker">Engineering confidence</p>
      <h2 id="confidence-title">A frame you can inspect before it reaches a screen.</h2>
      <p>
        Each update lowers through explicit phases. The pipeline page exposes
        the same model with a runnable walkthrough and implementation links.
      </p>
      <a href={`${base}/pipeline/`}>Inspect the rendering pipeline</a>
    </div>

    <ol class="phase-sequence" aria-label="SwiftTUI rendering pipeline">
      <li><span>Resolve</span><small>View graph</small></li>
      <li><span>Measure</span><small>Size proposals</small></li>
      <li><span>Place</span><small>Integer geometry</small></li>
      <li><span>Semantics</span><small>Accessible meaning</small></li>
      <li><span>Draw</span><small>Display commands</small></li>
      <li><span>Raster</span><small>Styled cells</small></li>
      <li class="phase-commit"><span>Commit</span><small>Host presentation</small></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="trust" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
  <div class="shell trust-layout">
    <div class="trust-copy">
      <p class="home-kicker">Pre-release boundary</p>
      <h2 id="trust-title">Useful now. Still allowed to change.</h2>
      <p>
        SwiftTUI 0.1.15 is pre-release software. Source-breaking changes are
        expected before 1.0, and external consumer support begins at 0.9.0.
      </p>
      <div class="trust-links">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/SwiftTUI/swift-tui/releases"
          rel="noreferrer noopener"
        >
          Read releases
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/SwiftTUI/swift-tui/issues"
          rel="noreferrer noopener"
        >
          Track issues
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="closing">
      <h2>Build the first frame.</h2>
      <div>
        <a
          class="home-button home-button--primary"
          href="https://github.com/SwiftTUI/swift-tui-examples/tree/main/three-hosts-demo"
          rel="noreferrer noopener"
        >
          Clone the counter
        </a>
        <a class="home-button" href={`${base}/docs/documentation/`}>
          Read the API reference
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .product-proof,
  .why,
  .hosts,
  .confidence,
  .trust {
    padding: clamp(88px, 11vw, 150px) 0;
  }

  .proof-head,
  .hosts-head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
  }

  .proof-head h2,
  .hosts-head h2,
  .confidence h2,
  .trust h2 {
    font-size: clamp(44px, 6.5vw, 82px);
    font-weight: 520;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.062em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .proof-head p,
  .hosts-head p,
  .confidence-copy > p:last-of-type,
  .trust-copy > p:last-of-type {
    max-width: 58ch;
    color: var(--home-muted);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .proof-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
  }

  .proof-item {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
  }

  .proof-item--wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .proof-item a {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #101512;
  }

  .proof-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 260ms ease;
  }

  .proof-item a:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.008);
  }

  .proof-item figcaption {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(140px, 0.38fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    min-height: 78px;
    padding: 17px 19px;
  }

  .proof-item figcaption strong {
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .proof-item figcaption span {
    color: var(--home-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .proof-link,
  .confidence-copy > a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 26px;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-accent);
    color: var(--home-accent-ink);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .why {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
  }

  .why-thesis {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 480px;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px);
  }

  .why-thesis > p {
    color: var(--home-accent-ink);
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .why-thesis h2 {
    align-self: flex-end;
    max-width: 12ch;
    font-size: clamp(56px, 8.6vw, 118px);
    font-weight: 480;
    line-height: 0.91;
    letter-spacing: -0.072em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .reason-list {
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
  }

  .reason-list > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(230px, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr);
    gap: clamp(30px, 7vw, 110px);
    padding: 30px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-line-strong);
  }

  .reason-list > div:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .reason-list dt {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.7vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 540;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .reason-list dd {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--home-muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .reason-list code {
    color: var(--home-accent-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .hosts {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
  }

  .host-map {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 0.78fr) minmax(0, 1.22fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
  }

  .engine {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 320px;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 28px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
    background: var(--home-accent);
    color: var(--home-accent-on);
  }

  .engine span {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .engine strong {
    max-width: 14ch;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.03;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .host-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .host-list span {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 104px;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: 20px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--home-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-line);
    color: var(--home-muted);
  }

  .host-list span:nth-child(2n) {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .host-list span:last-child {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .host-caveat {
    max-width: 86ch;
    margin: 15px 0 60px;
    color: var(--home-quiet);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .audience-paths {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
  }

  .audience-paths a {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(150px, 0.55fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr) auto;
    gap: 30px;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 104px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-line-strong);
    transition: padding 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
  }

  .audience-paths a:hover {
    padding-left: 10px;
    color: var(--home-accent-ink);
  }

  .audience-paths span {
    color: var(--home-muted);
  }

  .audience-paths strong {
    font-size: 19px;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .audience-paths i {
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-accent);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .confidence {
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--home-line-soft) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--home-line-soft) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 44px 44px;
  }

  .confidence-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 900px;
    padding: clamp(34px, 5vw, 70px);
    border: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
    background: var(--home-paper);
  }

  .phase-sequence {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 44px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .phase-sequence li {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 126px;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 16px 12px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--home-line);
    background: var(--home-paper);
  }

  .phase-sequence li:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .phase-sequence span,
  .phase-sequence small {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .phase-sequence span {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .phase-sequence small {
    color: var(--home-quiet);
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .phase-sequence .phase-commit {
    background: var(--home-accent);
    color: var(--home-accent-on);
  }

  .phase-sequence .phase-commit small {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--home-accent-on), transparent 22%);
  }

  .trust {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
  }

  .trust-layout {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(90px, 14vw, 180px);
  }

  .trust-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  .trust-copy h2 {
    max-width: 12ch;
  }

  .trust-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .trust-links a {
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-accent);
    color: var(--home-accent-ink);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .closing {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: end;
    padding-top: clamp(70px, 9vw, 120px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
  }

  .closing h2 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    font-size: clamp(60px, 9.5vw, 128px);
  }

  .closing > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 9px;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .host-map {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .engine {
      min-height: 230px;
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-ink);
    }

    .audience-paths a {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 22px 0;
    }

    .audience-paths i {
      justify-self: start;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .phase-sequence {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .phase-sequence li:nth-child(4) {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .phase-sequence li:nth-child(-n + 4) {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-line);
    }

    .closing {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .closing > div {
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .proof-gallery {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .proof-item--wide {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .proof-item figcaption {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .why-thesis {
      min-height: 430px;
    }

    .why-thesis h2 {
      font-size: clamp(50px, 15vw, 78px);
    }

    .reason-list > div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .host-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .host-list span,
    .host-list span:nth-child(2n) {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .host-list span:last-child {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .phase-sequence {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .phase-sequence li,
    .phase-sequence li:nth-child(4) {
      border-right: 1px solid var(--home-line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--home-line);
    }

    .phase-sequence li:nth-child(2n) {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .phase-sequence li:last-child {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .confidence-copy {
      padding: 28px 20px;
    }

    .closing > div {
      display: grid;
    }

    .closing .home-button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .proof-item img {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
